{"id":"vod_sn_37544","vodId":"37544","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"犬神同学和猫山同学","name_cn":"犬神同学和猫山同学","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3fca029a1515325b113fce6f27e2e08e.jpg"},"summary":"故事围绕着高中女生犬神八千代（上坂堇 配音），与猫山铃（东山奈央 配音）之间的百合关系展开。虽然名字里带个“犬”字，八千代实际上十分喜欢猫咪，是个“犬似的猫派”；而性格像猫一样容易害羞的傲娇少女猫山同学，却意外地喜欢狗狗，是“猫似的犬派”。在共同好友柊木秋（大坪由佳 配音）的撮合下，爱猫咪的犬神同学和爱狗狗的猫山同学开始了欢乐的百合生活，而不擅长应付动物的柊木秋就成为了她们之间的吐槽担当。　　本动画改编自日本漫画家kuzushiro创作的百合四格漫画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gaQrM7L3Jd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9nEMBtAuvQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/kXNNgQ0VqH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/shzKQPGVGX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7RM56cf6A81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mLd7fFveT21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/95zY0TsNgH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mjQHBYzkVY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CzUePJZVzm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ZVQAeyBypy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/4pLYamtcKX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/vJS1H3h1nT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ps7ELjxAmd1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:09.619Z"}